    {
      "text": "Stacked bar chart 'Per-test cost (Hain)' (Figure 2B) showing per-test cost in 2019 USD for the primary estimate (PE), low and high scenarios, split into overhead, building, staff, equipment and test kits. Totals are roughly $15 (PE), $10 (low) and $37 (high); test kits dominate the PE and low bars, and equipment is the largest component of the high bar.",
      "lang": "en",
      "state": "draft",
